From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:12:43 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] add Find My Phone support (overlay/asteroidos)

Add Matawaa's "Find My Phone" feature on top of upstream AsteroidOS:

- asteroid-btsyncd: add BLE synchronization packets and D-Bus commands
  compatible with Gadgetbridge, plus a find-phone CLI helper.
- asteroid-launcher: add a QuickPanel toggle that asks the companion
  phone to ring.
---
